# Local secrets. Without this, `COPY apps/<name> ./apps/<name>` copies a
# developer's .env — DATABASE_URL and session secrets — into an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Dependencies are installed inside the image from the lockfile; copying a
# host node_modules over that produces a different tree than Railway builds.
**/node_modules

# Build output. Each image builds its own.
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/build

# Version control and tooling caches
.git
.gitignore
**/.turbo
.vercel
.railway

# Editor and OS noise
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
